Root cause: `src/styles/elements/form.css` had a leftover scaffolding rule:
```css
fieldset > ul {
  background-color: red;
  display: inline;
}
```
It never matched before because step 5's seating-rules `<ul>` lived in the step's `<div class="stack">`. When the inner-jaws guidance moved inside the `<fieldset>` (previous change), the `ul` became a `fieldset > ul` child, so the rule started matching — giving a small red box (small because `display: inline` shrinks the background to the inline box).

